WEBVTT

NOTE
Captions for the founder film. Text is verbatim from the 29 July 2026 VSL
transcript, with two corrections: the transcriber wrote "Waxman" for Vaxman,
and "HEAL" is set as "Heal" per the brand naming rule. Cue times are derived
from the transcript's timecodes and may sit within about a second of the
audio, which is why the track is not marked default.

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:11.000
My name is Misha Vaxman, and I created Heal because I know what it feels like
to do years of work on yourself and still feel trapped inside of this recurring pattern.

2
00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:17.000
For more than 15 years, I explored personal development. I studied the work of
Tony Robbins, Wayne Dyer, Joe Dispenza, David Bayer.

3
00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:25.000
I attended retreats, explored meditation, and challenged myself through
practices such as extended water fasts.

4
00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.000
I understand a lot.

5
00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:32.000
But there were still parts of my life where understanding didn't create change.

6
00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:44.000
At one stage I was running a business with more than 20 staff, I had two children
under two, my wife wasn't working, and I was carrying the responsibility of being
the sole provider.

7
00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:47.000
From the outside, I was building something successful.

8
00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:52.000
Internally, I felt like I couldn't do anything right.

9
00:00:52.250 --> 00:01:02.000
I could analyze the pressure, I could understand where some of my beliefs came
from, but understanding them didn't automatically clear them.

10
00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:09.000
What began to change things for me was learning to stop guessing and begin
listening to the response of my own body.

11
00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:19.000
Muscle testing gave me a way to uncover beliefs and emotional patterns that my
conscious mind had learned to explain, justify, or just completely overlook.

12
00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:25.000
It helped me identify what actually was holding me underneath the surface.

13
00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:33.000
From there, I developed a structured framework to locate the pattern, listen to
what it's communicating, work with it, and then retest that original statement.

14
00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:35.800
That framework became the Heal method.
